warning[module-inception]: module `Shapes` is nested in module of same name
 --> positive.jl:3:8
  |
2 | module Shapes
  |        ------ parent module `Shapes`
3 | module Shapes
  |        ^^^^^^ inner module takes name `Shapes`
  |
  = why: outside code must write `Shapes.Shapes.x`; inside parent, `Shapes` no longer means parent
  = fix: rename inner module, or move its body into parent `Shapes`   [manual]
  = docs: corset explain module-inception
  = note: warn from readability group, library preset
  = note: opt out with `# corset: allow module-inception -- <reason>`

